Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Compatible with X5 - Support Makefile compilation -
 Default display through DSI - PNG and Zilib use x5 and file system libraries
 - Rename libmatrix/log.h to log.hpp because X5 conflicts with log.h in the
 file system - Rename all .cc files in the scene ideas directory to .cpp - Due
 to Makfile using *. cpp added source files, the code from other platforms
 (X11 and Android) has been removed - Execute the command as follows:/ glmark2
 --data-path ../data Signed-off-by: chengyu.he <chengyu.he@horizon.cc>

